{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_02",
  "title": "扩大防守范围",
  "storyCode": "OD-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8417f0f34ee8ae3ea53efbf1c7b843869f1028706e897390fdb90485e8db3684",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任务记录第184天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "截至目前为止，我们还是坚守在这个破屋子里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任务的第184天，到达前述破屋子的第27天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁能相信我们已经在这个地方生活了184天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们对这个世界依然毫无头绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两周前，按照本地人的指引，我们从破烂屋子前往了另一个城镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出发之前，镇子上的人说那是个“更发达的地方”，我不确定我们对发达一词的定义是否相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果呢？其实就是个土匪窝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有电池，没有任何有价值的情报，甚至没有找到一个能正常沟通的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，我们还是有点收获，蒂娜“弄”来了一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过程充满坎坷，还消耗了我们本来就不多的弹药补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在冲突中，车子也受损严重，开回破屋之后，这辆车就抛锚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚历山大试过修车，但这车连个加油口都没有，连带着也没发现油箱，发动机的构造完全弄不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他甚至到最后也不确定那个东西是不是发动机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯一的好消息是，这辆车是左舵的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来到这个世界已经半年了，如今我们非常确信这里不是地球。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们抢车，枪战，就像是一群活在后启示录电影里的亡命徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "枪战这个词不够精确，那些长着蜥蜴尾巴的土匪甚至不用枪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们能把十公斤重的投矛丢出去十几米远，能凭空丢出巨大的火球，用法介于手雷和火箭弹之间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个世界实在是太异常了，异常到我已经不会再感到惊讶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人的适应力往往超出了自己的预期，我们还得继续在这里挣扎求生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是我最后一次录音，我不打算再记录了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "录音笔的内存快满了，电池也坚持不了多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在这个世界上唯一能用的电源就是蒂娜的太阳能充电板，感谢这个世界上还有太阳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这块充电板损坏了该怎么办，如果我们的弹药补给都用完了该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说实话，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我依然对自己的当前生活缺乏实感，一切都发生得太过反常......又太过自然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回家的路在什么方向？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，乌曼，看看这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，你是不是不吃蔬菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我翻翻这里还剩些什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈！来见见乌曼，我的小家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你养了一只......这什么东西来着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石虫，本地人管这个东西叫源石虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你居然还有心思养这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢，我每天干坐在屋顶上，总得找点事情做，总不能和机枪聊天吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的工作是警戒周围的安全，不是逗变种蜗牛玩儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说的很有道理，但是警戒什么？是那些颤颤巍巍的病人，还是住在一公里开外，从来不靠近这边的镇民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段时间里唯一靠近这栋破屋子的生物是一只会飞的蜥蜴，还算是给大家加餐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......蒂娜和库兹呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们去找那些病人交换物资了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂娜昨天又猎到了一些东西，她越来越熟练了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂娜又一个人出去打猎了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，她可乐在其中，她最近在尝试抓一只“野生驮兽”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顺带，库兹去镇上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还记得我从车上拆下来的那个玩意儿吗？库兹说他认识镇上的一个机械师，他想去问问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你太焦虑了，科恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放松心态，反正我们短时间内都回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "学学库兹，去和那些人聊聊，这里的人还算友善。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还没学会本地人的语言，库兹这家伙，还真有两下子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是我担心的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "担心什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "库兹和他们走得太近了，这不是好事，本地的氛围很不正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个镇子里矛盾重重，我们到这儿已经快一个月了，别告诉我你看不出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个躲在大宅里足不出户的当地政府负责人......哦，确切说法是“领主”，以及他那全副武装的私人卫兵们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有这个“病人社区”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这整片区域都被同一个领主管辖，但病人不能居住在镇子里，其他镇民甚至不愿意靠近这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们是被赶到这边来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是因为这些朋友们“得了怪病”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瘟疫肆虐的时候把病人关在一起，历史上又不是没发生过这种事，至少本地领主没有把这些病人都关在大牢里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石病......还是矿石病？我不记得确切说法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们对这种病的了解仅限于：它和源石有关，它有传染性，它是不治之症。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但它究竟是怎么在人和人之间传播的？不治之症具体又是怎么个病法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没人回答过我们相关的问题，所有人都觉得我们理应掌握基本状况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种疾病要么是这座城镇的常识，要么就是这个世界的常识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只是与源石矿石的直接接触会导致问题，那我是不觉得这怪病有值得进行这种隔离的必要性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说，医生也觉得我们与病人的接触频度和距离没有被感染的风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个病人社区就是没有围墙的监牢，病人和镇民互相憎恨彼此，你不用看都能感觉到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的用词是“仇恨”，而不仅仅是排斥和歧视。仇恨刻在所有人的一举一动和一言一行里，是他们文化的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仇恨。你明白我的意思吗？这不仅仅是未知疾病的问题了，我们不该卷进本地人的这种冲突里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假设一个场景吧，如果镇民们举着火把和草叉，冲到这些病人的家里，你打算怎么办，对他们开枪么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可不好说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几个月来，我们的食物、饮水、药物可全都要感谢他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在更早之前，我们颠沛流离，艰难跋涉，在荒野中被任何会动的东西攻击，文明的痕迹遍寻不得......直到得到他们的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得我们能够“置身事外”吗，科恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他们拿着武器冲到米亚罗医生的诊所里，你难道要站在一边干看着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于你刚才说的问题，我觉得传播性是不容忽视的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这世界里的所有人都像是接受过最专业的化学战训练，不论男女老少都随时懂得遮住自己的口鼻，他们对呼吸道保护有着极强的敏感性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前也反复提过这点，所以我们才一定要准备类似的防护......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生也认可我们保持距离的做法。所幸病人们对此没有任何意见，对他们来说，这应该也是常态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生是怎么说的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没问过他，大家都没问过他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次和他聊到这个话题，他都很明显地表现出不想详谈的意愿，只要他觉得我们的防护措施没有问题，我也就不去追问了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我没有订披萨”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用对口令了，科恩小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，米亚罗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说医生医生到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等，我给你开门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，科恩小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早上好，亚历山大先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，我们刚聊到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你养了一只源石虫，亚历山大先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，这小东西还挺好玩，之前蒂娜一起抓来的，这只太小了，我就留着了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你是来找蒂娜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是来送东西的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是医疗品，这次剩下的比较多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感激不尽，医生，总是麻烦你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该说谢谢的是我，多亏了蒂娜小姐抓来的源石虫，这几个月大家都有镇痛剂用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以说这种“源石虫”还真的能治病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该怎么说呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿石病是治不好的......这种发酵源石虫体液的土方子只能缓解疼痛，并不是真的能治病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过对于感染者来说，能够缓解病痛已经难能可贵，体表结晶疼痛会影响正常生活，有些人甚至痛得下不了地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能帮到你们就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是你上次让我帮忙找的书，我特意找来了乌萨斯语的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好，让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能看懂吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有点困难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乍一看有点像俄语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是仔细看看，很多地方都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你至少有事情可以做了，就当多学一门外语吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总比逗蜗牛有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过说起语言，我们现在讲的这种语言你们怎么称呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然你们口音和用词都有点怪怪的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但应该是维多利亚语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那本地人呢，他们说的是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里的人都讲萨尔贡语，不过萨尔贡语也有很多方言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如萨尔贡东边雨林的部落人，他们的语言大部分萨尔贡人也听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还真有点复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯......乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯是个什么样的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个我其实不太清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前在学校里，他们说乌萨斯位于遥远的北方，常年被积雪覆盖，由皇帝统治。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我身边没人去过乌萨斯，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "皇帝？啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，听起来你有点失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍微有点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有机会的话，其实我还真想去看看这个叫乌萨斯的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "远游他乡......真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能只有你们这么厉害的人才能做到吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以的话，我也希望能去哥伦比亚完成我的学业，当个真正的医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我没有那么多钱，这里的病人还需要我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这么年轻，以后总会有机会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦对了，还有一件事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段时间，你们最好还是不要外出了，那辆车也得麻烦你们藏起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇子上出事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天晚上我看到领主的士兵在墙那边夜巡，这事情可不常见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实领主卫队在感染者区已经夜巡了一周了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇子里最近出现了......怪物，怪物袭击了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好家伙，这个世界的动物都怪成这样，我已经不敢想象怪物是什么样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇子上的人都在埋怨感染者，这几天你们要不要搬去我诊所的二楼？领主卫兵迟早会来检查废旧房屋的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样合适吗，医生？可能会给你带来很多麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这段时间帮了我这么多，我觉得没什么大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我赞同医生的观点，和领主卫队发生冲突也就是卷进当地治安事件，麻烦只会更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可不想和那群两米高的狗头人打起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......狗......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，这个，以后有机会我会给你讲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我没有订披萨”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚历山大！先开门！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是蒂娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷静点，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科恩！有麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一群镇民拿着刀枪棍棒堵在病人社区的路口，病人们也在和他们对峙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这群人来势汹汹，一直喊着要交出什么人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我刚才说什么来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是怕什么来什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "镇民？刀枪棍棒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？领主卫队是不允许普通镇民靠近感染者社区的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说明那些领主卫队已经无暇顾及这边了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！库兹呢？库兹早上是不是去镇子里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "库兹早上说要去镇子里找一个机械师，然后一直没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先去看看，至少得确定库兹在不在那边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要带武器吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......带上，以防万一，但是不到万不得已不要动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先交给我，你们不要急，我和镇子上的人比较熟悉，我来和他们交涉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......听你的，医生，但是一定要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，镇子上的人......还是讲道理的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_deserttownD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把人交出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把刚才那个鬼鬼祟祟的人交出来！我们都看到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们瞎扯什么呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别想骗我，你们这群污染源，我就知道最近的事情都是你们搞的鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘恩负义的蛀虫，领主就不该留着你们！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚才看到一个裹得严严实实的大个子从镇子里出来，偷偷跑过来了，把他交出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你们在说什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，既然你们要装傻到底，我们也不需要客气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来人啊！给我砸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你敢！你以为我们是好欺负的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来人啊！他们要打人啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，别动手！别动手！我们聊聊，先别动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀！库兹先生，我不是让你躲着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，别担心，让我和他们说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这口音，你不是本地人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快说，你是谁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唉......这可怎么办。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是个商人，捡垃圾的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商人？既然是商人有什么不能见人的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你袍子下面鼓鼓囊囊的是什么，让我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他抓起来！带到领主那边去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好，我听你的，我和你们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们没必要动手对吧，我会和你们的“领主”解释清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "库兹先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把这几个人也抓起来，我怀疑他们都是同谋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！不要太过分了！你有什么资格喊抓人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟，你这样就很不讲道理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些朋友只是买了我打猎抓来的源石虫，卖源石虫总不犯法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知道你们有没有勾结在一起干什么阴险勾当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_165",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓起来......把他们都抓起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！你们要忤逆图拉大人的指示吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生！你终于来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......米亚罗医生，真是不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "图拉大人有规定，任何人不准靠近这个社区，除非你也是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，你们也是感染者吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你少在这里油嘴滑舌，你和这个外地人什么关系，说清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然我们把你也抓起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是我的病人，没有人规定我的诊所不能收治外来的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，你想要拦着我，你倒是试试看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别在这里浪费时间，先把人带走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们几个......不是镇子上的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生在和那些人理论，但是对方看起来不依不饶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不像是能和平解决的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不要着急，交给医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科恩，不太对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到那几个躲在后面的大个子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们背着什么东西？用布裹着的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个尺寸，恐怕不是农具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "普通农民会背着这种长兵器吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就算在这个世界，我看农民也不太可能背着巨剑种田。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不是来讲道理的，科恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先不要轻举妄动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们两个掩护我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臭小子，不想死，就闭上你的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不是本地人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来没有见过你们，你们到底是什么人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们想干什么，说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊，你们贼喊捉贼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卫兵！这里有入侵者！卫兵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_164",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来人啊！有入侵者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的话太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该闭嘴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "医生，趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铳器！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是雇佣兵！"
    },
    {
